{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-coding","title":"AI 编程","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":7,"docCount":23,"url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.81,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.75}},"introMarkdown":"# AI 编程 简介\n\nAI 编程正在重新定义软件开发的方式。随着大语言模型（LLM）能力的飞速提升，开发者不再只是手写每一行代码，而是与 AI 协同完成从构思到交付的全过程。这本手册将带你系统地理解 AI 辅助编程的核心原理、工具生态与最佳实践。\n\n本手册面向希望深入理解 AI 编程工具运作机制并高效运用它们的开发者。无论你是刚接触 AI 编程的新手，还是已有一定经验希望进阶的实践者，都能在这里找到有价值的内容。\n\n我们从**基础概念**出发，介绍 AI 编程的全景图、大语言模型的基本原理，以及提示工程的核心技巧。理解这些基础，是有效运用一切 AI 编程工具的前提。\n\n接下来深入**Agent 架构**，探讨 AI 编程助手背后的智能体设计。你将了解 Agent 的基本范式、SubAgent 的协作机制、ReAct 推理-行动循环，以及规划与反思策略如何让 AI 更可靠地完成复杂任务。\n\n**上下文与记忆**是 AI 编程能力的关键瓶颈。我们将剖析上下文窗口的管理策略、记忆系统的设计思路，以及 AI 如何理解和导航大规模代码库，从而在有限的上下文中做出最优决策。\n\n在**工具与能力**章节，我们聚焦于 AI 编程助手的能力扩展体系——Tool 系统如何让 AI 与外部世界交互，Skill 系统如何封装可复用的工作流，Rule 系统如何约束和引导 AI 的行为，三者共同构成了 AI 编程助手的能力基座。\n\n**工作流与规范**章节关注实际开发中的协作模式。从 Spec 驱动的开发流程，到任务规划与分解策略，再到不同场景下的工作模式选择，帮助你建立高效的人机协作工作流。\n\n**AI 编程工具**章节全面梳理当前工具生态，涵盖 Trae、Cursor、Claude Code、Codex 等主流 AI IDE 和终端工具，以及背后的模型与服务选型，帮助你根据自身需求做出合理选择。\n\n最后，**实践与进阶**章节将所有知识融会贯通。我们探讨人机协作的实战模式、AI 辅助调试与代码审查的技巧，以及如何构建自定义 Agent 来满足特定场景的需求。\n\nAI 编程不是要取代开发者，而是赋予开发者前所未有的杠杆效应。掌握这些知识，你将能够更从容地驾驭 AI 工具，在保持代码质量的同时大幅提升开发效率。让我们开始这段探索之旅。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础概念","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-coding-overview","title":"AI 编程概述","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/foundations/ai-coding-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"llm-basics","title":"大语言模型基础","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/foundations/llm-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prompt-engineering","title":"提示工程","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/foundations/prompt-engineering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"agent-patterns","title":"Agent 架构","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-fundamentals","title":"Agent 核心概念","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/agent-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"subagent-and-multi-agent","title":"SubAgent 与多智能体","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/subagent-and-multi-agent"},{"seq":3,"slug":"react-pattern","title":"ReAct 模式","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/react-pattern"},{"seq":4,"slug":"planning-and-reflection","title":"规划与反思","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/planning-and-reflection"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"context-and-memory","title":"上下文与记忆","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/context-and-memory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"context-management","title":"Context 上下文管理","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/context-and-memory/context-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-systems","title":"Memory 记忆系统","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/context-and-memory/memory-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"codebase-understanding","title":"代码库理解","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/context-and-memory/codebase-understanding"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"tools-and-capabilities","title":"工具与能力","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/tools-and-capabilities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tool-systems","title":"Tool 工具系统","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/tools-and-capabilities/tool-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"skill-systems","title":"Skill 技能系统","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/tools-and-capabilities/skill-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rule-systems","title":"Rule 规则系统","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/tools-and-capabilities/rule-systems"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"workflow-and-specs","title":"工作流与规范","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/workflow-and-specs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spec-driven-development","title":"Spec 规范驱动开发","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/workflow-and-specs/spec-driven-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plan-and-task-decomposition","title":"Plan 计划与任务分解","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/workflow-and-specs/plan-and-task-decomposition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"workflow-patterns","title":"工作流模式","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/workflow-and-specs/workflow-patterns"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"ai-coding-tools","title":"AI 编程工具","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/ai-coding-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-ide-overview","title":"AI IDE 概览","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/ai-coding-tools/ai-ide-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-terminal-tools","title":"AI 终端工具","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/ai-coding-tools/ai-terminal-tools"},{"seq":3,"slug":"models-and-services","title":"模型与服务","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/ai-coding-tools/models-and-services"}]},{"seq":7,"slug":"practice","title":"实践与进阶","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"collaboration-patterns","title":"高效协作模式","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/practice/collaboration-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"debugging-with-ai","title":"调试与排错","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/practice/debugging-with-ai"},{"seq":3,"slug":"code-review-and-quality","title":"代码审查与质量","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/practice/code-review-and-quality"},{"seq":4,"slug":"building-custom-agents","title":"构建自定义 Agent","url":"/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/practice/building-custom-agents"}]}]}